        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you “play” this game?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To play this thrilling action game, you must agree to all <strong>12 terms and conditions</strong>.<br>Before you start playing, be sure to review the terms and click <strong>Agree</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757210/extras/4c49768c034b31e80c782eccbcb5e8a5.poster.avif?t=1777735933\" width=542 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757210/extras/4c49768c034b31e80c782eccbcb5e8a5.webm?t=1777735933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757210/extras/4c49768c034b31e80c782eccbcb5e8a5.mp4?t=1777735933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The agreement screens in this game are designed with various gimmicks to prevent automated computer inputs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some screens may have intentionally tricky controls before you can reach the <strong>Agree</strong> button — please be aware of this in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757210/extras/c851f6d8d781035afcf7fc5d61b90992.avif?t=1777735933\" width=543 height=305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notice of Bug:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When opening the Terms of Service confirmation popup, there is a bug where the timer starts before agreeing to the Terms of Service. Since fixing this issue would be a hassle, we have decided to leave it as is. Please understand that the official rule will be to compete for the fastest time from when the Terms of Service agreement begins to when you clear the &quot;Heart-Pounding Action Game.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The terms and conditions presented in this game are fictional and created solely for entertainment purposes. They hold no actual legal validity.</p>",
